<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 1,900 MT were primarily for the United Arab Emirates (1,000 MT) and Jamaica (1,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 2,800 MT were to Mexico (2,300 MT) and the United Arab Emirates (500 MT).</p>
</text>
